WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Hey, it's Laura. This is a placeholder video.

00:03.500 --> 00:08.000
I'll record the real one soon, but here's the idea behind this post.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.500
Most RFCs I read are long, and the decision is hiding on page three.

00:12.500 --> 00:17.000
So I wrote down what I've learned about making them easy to say yes or no to.

00:17.000 --> 00:21.000
Keep scrolling. I'll stay here in the corner while you read.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
Thanks for reading.
